    "created_at": "2024-01-25T04:29:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-25T04:29:03Z",
    "body": "Is the goal to add a one-off check to Encoding, or to throw at the Web IDL layer? The latter would be kind of nice, but perhaps scarier.",
