    "created_at": "2024-02-01T16:12:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-01T16:12:56Z",
    "body": "This also applies to `TextDecoder`'s `decode()` and looking at https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-get-buffer-source-copy the handling of detached buffers is pretty intentional at least for that and APIs like it.\r\n\r\nI suspect it's all aligned with the original non-throwy view APIs. This makes me a bit more worried about introducing a throw here and there as it seems unlikely we will be able to be consistent.\r\n\r\nThoughts?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
