    "created_at": "2025-04-22T11:46:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-22T11:46:16Z",
    "body": "Agreed, but I think the fix should be in Web IDL then. In that destination's byte length would be 0 for a detached view/buffer and everything would flow from there.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
